# 4. Workstream C — Product Feed Validation & Safe Export

Inspect:

- `src/domain/feed/feedValidationEngine.ts`
- Feed export services and routes.
- Product and variant data models.
- Tests and official feed requirements.

Confirmed defects:

- Missing product price can be exported as `0.00`.
- Missing merchant SKU can fall back to an internal product ID.
